        "slc_c772f846f12148a4965079df59290e0eb7d6b796ebeae626c8a1e14f70ba5a3c"
      ],
      "text": "The server exposes a ref_search_documentation tool with a required query parameter, described as a full sentence or question, for searching public web/GitHub docs and private resources like repos and PDFs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_973419ecabeb941eff6d37a2020ab402bec76b60777e073359002896a9082282",
