        "slc_464aaccbcaad49e26be54491ed65f2f404d84f26be3bb969c9dee8a09d0ab51e"
      ],
      "text": "A ref_read_url tool fetches a URL, converts the content to markdown, takes a required url parameter, and is designed to pair with search results."
    },
